---
// Closing statement, centred: a label, one big heading with the key word in the accent colour and
// two sentences, over the block field gone calm.
---

<section id="closing" class="py-32 sm:py-44" data-scene="bulb">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal ground max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="label label-mark">why a person, not just a prompt</p>
      <h2 class="mt-6 text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[0.98]" data-split>Experience decides what to <span class="hl">build.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-8 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] mx-auto text-muted">
        AI writes code fast, and I use it every day. It does not know your business, what breaks in production at night, or which shortcut costs you a year later.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] mx-auto text-muted">
        Someone who has shipped it before builds it in a fraction of the time, with fewer surprises, and leaves you a system you can still run in five years.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
